  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HCFC PHASE-OUT MANAGEMENT PLAN (Stage I)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to develop the first stage of the Compliance Strategy for the reduction of the use of the substances controlled under Annex C Group I (HCFCs) of the Montreal Protocol, and an Action Plan covering a first and second phase form 2012 to 2020 in order to comply with the 2013 HCFC freeze, the 2015 10% HCFC reduction, and the 2020 25% HCFC reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
